# Deploy to GitHub Pages

When local verification succeeds:

1. Run `npm run build` (and `npm test` / `npm run build:gh` if relevant).
2. If green, commit on `main` (or merge to `main`), then **push to GitHub without waiting for the user to ask**:

```bash
git push origin main
git push github main
```

- Remote `github` → `https://github.com/alexbaumgertner/the-game.git`
- GitHub Actions deploys Pages to https://alexbaumgertner.github.io/the-game/
- Do **not** push a broken build. Fix first, then push.
